<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Simple HTML Structure</title>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to My Web Page</h1>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <article>
            <h2>About Nature</h2>

            <p>
                Nature is beautiful and full of wonders.
                It provides us with <span style="color: green;">fresh air,
                water, and a peaceful environment.</span>
            </p>

            <figure>
                <img src="https://placehold.co/600x300"
                     alt="A beautiful nature landscape">
                <figcaption>
                    A beautiful landscape representing the beauty of nature.
                </figcaption>
            </figure>
        </article>

        <aside>
            <h3>Quick Link</h3>
            <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 My Web Page. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer

</body>
</html>
